flowchart TD
  Account[Commercial Account и owner membership] --> Billing[Billing profile и onboarding]
  Billing --> Draft[Draft subscription и published plan price]
  Draft --> Invoice[Issued invoice и неизменяемые строки]
  Invoice --> Payment[CreatePayment с idempotency key]
  Payment --> Free{Сумма равна нулю?}
  Free -->|Да| Settle[Локальный settlement]
  Free -->|Нет| Attempt[PaymentAttempt и постоянный provider request key]
  Attempt --> Network[Внешний вызов вне DB-транзакции]
  Network --> Outcome{Достоверный результат?}
  Outcome -->|Timeout| Pending[Uncertain: lookup и reconciliation]
  Pending --> Network
  Outcome -->|Отказ| Failed[Нет активации и нет новых прав]
  Outcome -->|Успех| Authoritative[Authoritative provider state и проверка суммы]
  Authoritative --> Settle
  Settle --> Atomic[Одна транзакция: paid invoice, payment, subscription, audit и outbox]
  Atomic --> Rights[Derived entitlements и подписанный Tenant document]
